title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0 and not started
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 10;
card-image: img/es/parties/casa_pueblo.jpg
go-to: rm_main

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @remove_none: Don't change advisors.
- @easy_discard


###################### removing leaders

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors.
tags: center_advisor, left_advisor, reformist_advisor, labor_advisor, neorev_advisor, nonfactional_advisor 
on-arrival: {!
Q.last_time_check = Q.time;
if (Q.time > Q.last_time_check) {
    Q.advisor_1 = [];

    for (let key in Q) {
        if (key.endsWith('_advisor') && Q[key] === 1) {
            Q.advisor_1.push(key.replace('_advisor', ''));
        }
    }
}
console.log(Q.advisor_1)
!}
frequency: 1
go-to: rm_main_menu

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> is a diverse and <span class="tooltip-text" title="good mod">dynamic</span> party, but its internal divisions cause factional dissent to gradually increase over time. [? if ceda_r >= 20: However, the threat posed by the <span style="color: #0087DC;">**CEDA**</span> to the Republic has quieted much of the internal bickering. ?]

Appointing individual advisors will boost their respective faction’s loyalty and influence, at the cost of increasing resentment among the sidelined factions.

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Caballerista left favors revolutionary class struggle and cooperation with the PCE.">Caballerista</span>!} strength: [+ left_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ left_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Besteiristas follow orthodox Marxism, between reform and revolution.">Besteirista</span>!} strength: [+ center_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ center_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The UGT's goal is economic reform and benefits for organized workers.">UGT</span>!} strength: [+ labor_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ labor_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Prietistas are pragmatic participants in government, and seek to expand the welfare state and defend the Republic.">Prietista</span>!} strength: [+ reformist_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ reformist_dissent : dissent +]

@rm_main_menu

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors.
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_2 = [];

for (let key in Q) {
    if (key.endsWith('_advisor') && Q[key] === 1) {
        Q.advisor_2.push(key.replace('_advisor', ''));
    }
}

console.log(Q.advisor_2)

function arraysAreEqual(arr1, arr2) {
    if (arr1.length !== arr2.length) return false;
    for (let i = 0; i < arr1.length; i++) {
        if (arr1[i] !== arr2[i]) return false;
    }
    return true;
}

if (arraysAreEqual(Q.advisor_1, Q.advisor_2)) {
    Q.shuffle_leadership_timer = 0;
} else {
    Q.kleber_der_partei = 0;
}
!}
go-to: root
tags: remove_advisor


