title: Toribio Echevarría
subtitle: Toribio Echevarría is a self-taught worker-intellectual from Eibar who bridges the party to the observant Catholic workers of the north.
is-card: true
card-image: img/es/leaders/echevarria.jpg
view-if: wirth_advisor = 0 and wirth_spd and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: wirth_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; neorevisionist_strength += 5; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: neorev_advisor

Toribio Echevarría is now an advisor.

# Nonfactional advisors

@add_baade
title: Lucio Martínez Gil
subtitle: Lucio Martínez Gil is the secretary-general of the FNTT landworkers' federation and the party's voice on the agrarian question. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Agricultural Policy, Rural Campaigning, Addressing the Economic Crisis ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/es/parties/pablo_iglesias_casa_pueblo.jpg
view-if: baade_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: baade_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: nonfactional_advisor

Lucio Martínez Gil is now an advisor.


@add_hirschfeld
title: Gregorio Marañón
subtitle: Gregorio Marañón is Spain's most eminent physician and a rare public voice for the rights of sexual minorities. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Sexual Minority Rights, Women's Rights, Science Funding ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/es/leaders/maranon.png
view-if: hirschfeld_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: hirschfeld_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: nonfactional_advisor

Gregorio Marañón is now an advisor.


@add_radbruch
title: Fernando de los Ríos
subtitle: Fernando de los Ríos is a distinguished legal scholar and the party's Minister of Justice. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Judicial Affairs, Constitutional Reform ?]
