Fernando de los Ríos is now an advisor.


@add_stampfer
title: Julián Zugazagoitia
subtitle: Julián Zugazagoitia is the editor-in-chief of <span style="color: #c00000;">*El Socialista*</span>, the party's newspaper. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Media, Editorial Line, Cooperation with the <span style="color: #8a0303;">PCE</span> ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/es/leaders/zugazagoitia.jpg
view-if: stampfer_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and not stampfer_killed
on-arrival: stampfer_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: nonfactional_advisor

Julián Zugazagoitia is now an advisor.


